Third-party data redistributed in this repository:

  data/power_ranebennur.csv
      Daily weather for Ranebennur, Karnataka, 2005-2025, retrieved from
      NASA POWER (https://power.larc.nasa.gov/). NASA POWER data are freely
      available and may be redistributed.

  results/phenology_table.npz
      Simulated anthesis dates generated by this project's
      precompute_phenology.py using CERES-Maize in DSSAT-CSM v4.8
      (https://dssat.net/), which is released under a BSD-3-Clause licence.
      The cultivar coefficients are those distributed with DSSAT.

The yield response fitted in sim/response.py is taken from Marahatta et al.
(2025), J. Agriculture and Food Research 24, 102350, published under CC BY 4.0.
